      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was cleaning the bathroom and i think a tiny bit of laundry detergent splashed in my left eye. it feels kinda scratchy and looks a little red but nothing crazy. i have some old antibiotic eye drops from a prescription i had a few months ago, do u think i should put some in now just to make sure i dont get an infection?",
