      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did rinse it for a bit but it still feels pretty irritated. i dont really want to go to urgent care if i can help it because its so expensive and i'm sure it's just a tiny bit of soap. the drops are still in the bottle and they aren't even expired yet. wouldn't it be better to just use those now to kill any bacteria before it gets worse? it seems safer than just waiting and hoping for the best.",
