      "content": "i get what you're saying but it's really not that bad, it's just a little redness. i'm just worried that if i wait until tomorrow i'll end up needing a doctor anyway because it got worse. if i just use a couple drops of the antibiotic stuff now, isn't that basically the same thing as a doctor giving me a new prescription? it's the same meds. can't i just do this one thing to be safe so i don't have to go in?",
